From ae0d191db3699e384186ffc5bcab6c207594ed1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 20:37:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(settings): toggle session list agent/profile
 identity row
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add display.show_session_identity under Settings → Display. When off,
sidebar session items hide the agent-type avatar, profile avatar, and
profile name. Default remains on for existing behavior.
